source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A killed brace-form opener is given up whole, so the asterisk inside the braces opens instead and Jira bolds `}a*b`; jiro reads a literal brace and that bold effect.
-- input.jira --
{*}a*b*
-- rendered.html --
<p>{<b>}a*b</b></p>
-- want.md --
{**}a\*b**
-- warnings.json --
[]
